बनाती है।', `marriage_text` = 'वैवाहिक जीवन में अनुकूलता का स्कोर 7.7/10 है। एक सुखी गृहस्थी के निर्माण के लिए दोनों को पारिवारिक दायित्वों और घरेलू निर्णयों में संतुलन बनाए रखना आवश्यक है। जब दोनों साथी एक-दूसरे के आत्मसम्मान और अधिकारों का सम्मान करते हैं, तो दांपत्य जीवन में सुख, शांति और समृद्धि का वास होता है।', `kids_text` = 'संतान सुख और पारिवारिक परवरिश के क्षेत्र में इनका तालमेल 6.9/10 है। मेष बच्चों में आत्मविश्वास, साहस और अनुशासन का संचार करते हैं, जबकि मेष उन्हें स्नेह, संस्कार और भावनात्मक सुरक्षा प्रदान करती हैं। माता-पिता के रूप में इनका संयुक्त दृष्टिकोण बच्चों के सर्वांगीण विकास के लिए अत्यंत लाभकारी सिद्ध होता है।', `finance_text` = 'आर्थिक प्रबंधन और धन संचय में दोनों का तालमेल 6.8/10 है। मेष नए अवसरों और प्रगतिशील योजनाओं में रुचि रखते हैं, जबकि मेष बचत, स्थिरता और भविष्य की सुरक्षा पर बल देती हैं। साझा बजट और पारदर्शी वित्तीय निर्णयों से दोनों अपने परिवार के लिए एक सुदृढ़ आर्थिक आधार तैयार करते हैं।' WHERE `id` = 4;
UPDATE `zodiac_compatibility` SET `slug` = 'aries-man-taurus-woman', `element_pair` = 'Fire + Earth', `meta_title` = 'Aries Man and Taurus Woman Compatibility: Love, Marriage & Trust (63%)', `meta_description` = 'Explore Aries man and Taurus woman compatibility (63%). Discover how Fire and Earth elements align in love, marriage, trust, emotional intimacy, and long-term harmony.', `verdict_summary` = 'A dynamic relationship of growth that flourishes through mutual understanding between Aries''s passionate spirit and Taurus''s grounded perspective. By honoring their distinct styles, they turn natural elemental contrasts into an enduring partnership.', `key_strength` = 'Their strongest resonance lies in Dependability (6.9/10). Here, combining visionary inspiration and courageous action with pragmatic structure and lasting security. Under the combined guidance of Mars and Venus, they bring out each other''s finest qualities.', `key_challenge` = 'Their primary area of conscious work occurs in Love (6.2/10). Potential tension arises from differences in pacing; Fire craves immediate momentum while Earth requires methodical deliberation. Fire must respect Earth’s thoughtful pacing, while Earth can allow Fire to ignite spontaneous joy.', `faq_json` = '[{"question": "Are an Aries man and a Taurus woman compatible in marriage?", "answer": "Yes, Aries man and Taurus woman hold a marriage compatibility score of 6.2/10. Their union succeeds when Aries''s unstoppable momentum complements Taurus''s unshakable reliability, providing a stable balance of passion and loyalty."}, {"question": "How do Aries and Taurus build lasting trust?", "answer": "With a trust rating of 6.4/10, security is established through transparent dialogue and consistent actions. Fire must respect Earth’s thoughtful pacing, while Earth can allow Fire to ignite spontaneous joy."}, {"question": "What is the secret to resolving conflict between an Aries man and a Taurus woman?", "answer": "The key is navigating Fire and Earth temperaments. He should appreciate Taurus''s natural emotional rhythm, while she gives Aries the space and respect needed to speak openly without defensiveness."}]', `general_text` = 'The connection between an Aries man and a Taurus woman is a compelling blend of Fire and Earth forces. Representing distinct cosmic energies, their overall compatibility stands at 6.3/10 (63%). He enters the relationship with a passionate, direct, energetic, fiercely independent presence, while she contributes a grounded, loyal, sensual, deeply patient energy. When their cosmic currents align, their combining visionary inspiration and courageous action with pragmatic structure and lasting security creates a vibrant environment where both partners feel recognized, celebrated, and inspired to grow.', `love_text` = 'In romance (6.2/10), this union is infused with genuine passion and romantic discovery. Ruled by Mars, Aries conveys affection through unstoppable momentum, while Taurus, influenced by Venus, expresses love through unshakable reliability. Their romantic chemistry thrives when both partners honor each other''s pace, expressing tenderness through meaningful shared moments and unconditional devotion.', `friendship_text` = 'As companions (6.6/10), their rapport is built on mutual curiosity and shared activities. Whether engaging in energetic debates or embarking on weekend getaways, their connection benefits from combining visionary inspiration and courageous action with pragmatic structure and lasting security. They uplift one another, offering a supportive sounding board where new plans and ideas are met with genuine encouragement.', `trust_text` = 'Trust and fidelity achieve a score of 6.4/10. Aries values transparency and authentic intention, whereas Taurus thrives when emotional reliability is proven day after day. To deepen their bond, they must keep commitments, address uncertainties before they fester, and create a safe emotional sanctuary free from judgment.', `dependability_text` = 'Dependability rates at 6.9/10 in this partnership. During unforeseen life hurdles, he steps up with courageous leadership, while she provides enduring loyalty. By dividing responsibilities according to their natural talents, they establish a secure, well-coordinated team.', `longevity_text` = 'The long-term resilience of this couple is rated at 6.3/10. A sustainable bond relies on both individuals continually reinventing their shared goals as seasons change. By embracing personal growth and avoiding stagnation, this Fire + Earth relationship deepens into an enduring life companionship.', `marriage_text` = 'In matrimony (6.2/10), establishing domestic harmony and shared core values is the cornerstone of success. A Aries man and Taurus woman create a thriving home when household choices, family rituals, and conflict resolutions are handled equitably. Honoring their elemental differences ensures both partners feel equally cherished and empowered within the marriage.', `kids_text` = 'When raising children and cultivating family life (6.9/10), this couple balances warmth with constructive guidance. Aries inspires their children with confidence, curiosity, and vitality, while Taurus surrounds them with emotional security, practical ethics, and unconditional care. Together, they provide a well-rounded and nurturing upbringing.', `finance_text` = 'Financial cooperation reaches a rating of 6.8/10. Aries''s approach to resources balances ambition and opportunity, while Taurus emphasizes foresight, stability, and prudent management. By maintaining transparent budgets and agreeing on joint investment priorities, they construct a prosperous and stress-free economic future.' WHERE `id` = 5;
