संबंध को उम्र भर का अटूट साथ बनाती है।', `marriage_text` = 'वैवाहिक जीवन में अनुकूलता का स्कोर 6.2/10 है। एक सुखी गृहस्थी के निर्माण के लिए दोनों को पारिवारिक दायित्वों और घरेलू निर्णयों में संतुलन बनाए रखना आवश्यक है। जब दोनों साथी एक-दूसरे के आत्मसम्मान और अधिकारों का सम्मान करते हैं, तो दांपत्य जीवन में सुख, शांति और समृद्धि का वास होता है।', `kids_text` = 'संतान सुख और पारिवारिक परवरिश के क्षेत्र में इनका तालमेल 6.9/10 है। मेष बच्चों में आत्मविश्वास, साहस और अनुशासन का संचार करते हैं, जबकि वृषभ उन्हें स्नेह, संस्कार और भावनात्मक सुरक्षा प्रदान करती हैं। माता-पिता के रूप में इनका संयुक्त दृष्टिकोण बच्चों के सर्वांगीण विकास के लिए अत्यंत लाभकारी सिद्ध होता है।', `finance_text` = 'आर्थिक प्रबंधन और धन संचय में दोनों का तालमेल 6.8/10 है। मेष नए अवसरों और प्रगतिशील योजनाओं में रुचि रखते हैं, जबकि वृषभ बचत, स्थिरता और भविष्य की सुरक्षा पर बल देती हैं। साझा बजट और पारदर्शी वित्तीय निर्णयों से दोनों अपने परिवार के लिए एक सुदृढ़ आर्थिक आधार तैयार करते हैं।' WHERE `id` = 8;
UPDATE `zodiac_compatibility` SET `slug` = 'aries-man-gemini-woman', `element_pair` = 'Fire + Air', `meta_title` = 'Aries Man and Gemini Woman Compatibility: Love, Marriage & Trust (73%)', `meta_description` = 'Explore Aries man and Gemini woman compatibility (73%). Discover how Fire and Air elements align in love, marriage, trust, emotional intimacy, and long-term harmony.', `verdict_summary` = 'A dynamic relationship of growth that flourishes through mutual understanding between Aries''s passionate spirit and Gemini''s witty perspective. By honoring their distinct styles, they turn natural elemental contrasts into an enduring partnership.', `key_strength` = 'Their strongest resonance lies in Friendship (7.6/10). Here, limitless intellectual stimulation, high sociability, vibrant humor, and infectious optimism. Under the combined guidance of Mars and Mercury, they bring out each other''s finest qualities.', `key_challenge` = 'Their primary area of conscious work occurs in Dependability (6.7/10). Potential tension arises from burning through emotional stamina quickly, moving on before feelings are fully anchored. Anchor high-flying concepts into tangible habits to ensure your fiery ideas yield enduring real-world results.', `faq_json` = '[{"question": "Are an Aries man and a Gemini woman compatible in marriage?", "answer": "Yes, Aries man and Gemini woman hold a marriage compatibility score of 7.2/10. Their union succeeds when Aries''s unstoppable momentum complements Gemini''s sparkling communication, providing a stable balance of passion and loyalty."}, {"question": "How do Aries and Gemini build lasting trust?", "answer": "With a trust rating of 6.9/10, security is established through transparent dialogue and consistent actions. Anchor high-flying concepts into tangible habits to ensure your fiery ideas yield enduring real-world results."}, {"question": "What is the secret to resolving conflict between an Aries man and a Gemini woman?", "answer": "The key is navigating Fire and Air temperaments. He should appreciate Gemini''s natural emotional rhythm, while she gives Aries the space and respect needed to speak openly without defensiveness."}]', `general_text` = 'The connection between an Aries man and a Gemini woman is a compelling blend of Fire and Air forces. Representing distinct cosmic energies, their overall compatibility stands at 7.3/10 (73%). He enters the relationship with a passionate, direct, energetic, fiercely independent presence, while she contributes a witty, versatile, intellectually curious, adaptable energy. When their cosmic currents align, their limitless intellectual stimulation, high sociability, vibrant humor, and infectious optimism creates a vibrant environment where both partners feel recognized, celebrated, and inspired to grow.', `love_text` = 'In romance (7.4/10), this union is infused with genuine passion and romantic discovery. Ruled by Mars, Aries conveys affection through unstoppable momentum, while Gemini, influenced by Mercury, expresses love through sparkling communication. Their romantic chemistry thrives when both partners honor each other''s pace, expressing tenderness through meaningful shared moments and unconditional devotion.', `friendship_text` = 'As companions (7.6/10), their rapport is built on mutual curiosity and shared activities. Whether engaging in energetic debates or embarking on weekend getaways, their connection benefits from limitless intellectual stimulation, high sociability, vibrant humor, and infectious optimism. They uplift one another, offering a supportive sounding board where new plans and ideas are met with genuine encouragement.', `trust_text` = 'Trust and fidelity achieve a score of 6.9/10. Aries values transparency and authentic intention, whereas Gemini thrives when emotional reliability is proven day after day. To deepen their bond, they must keep commitments, address uncertainties before they fester, and create a safe emotional sanctuary free from judgment.', `dependability_text` = 'Dependability rates at 6.7/10 in this partnership. During unforeseen life hurdles, he steps up with courageous leadership, while she provides endless playfulness. By dividing responsibilities according to their natural talents, they establish a secure, well-coordinated team.', `longevity_text` = 'The long-term resilience of this couple is rated at 7.2/10. A sustainable bond relies on both individuals continually reinventing their shared goals as seasons change. By embracing personal growth and avoiding stagnation, this Fire + Air relationship deepens into an enduring life companionship.', `marriage_text` = 'In matrimony (7.2/10), establishing domestic harmony and shared core values is the cornerstone of success. A Aries man and Gemini woman create a thriving home when household choices, family rituals, and conflict resolutions are handled equitably. Honoring their elemental differences ensures both partners feel equally cherished and empowered within the marriage.', `kids_text` = 'When raising children and cultivating family life (7.0/10), this couple balances warmth with constructive guidance. Aries inspires their children with confidence, curiosity, and vitality, while Gemini surrounds them with emotional security, practical ethics, and unconditional care. Together, they provide a well-rounded and nurturing upbringing.', `finance_text` = 'Financial cooperation reaches a rating of 6.7/10. Aries''s approach to resources balances ambition and opportunity, while Gemini emphasizes foresight, stability, and prudent management. By maintaining transparent budgets and agreeing on joint investment priorities, they construct a prosperous and stress-free economic future.' WHERE `id` = 9;
