भर का अटूट साथ बनाती है।', `marriage_text` = 'वैवाहिक जीवन में अनुकूलता का स्कोर 6.6/10 है। एक सुखी गृहस्थी के निर्माण के लिए दोनों को पारिवारिक दायित्वों और घरेलू निर्णयों में संतुलन बनाए रखना आवश्यक है। जब दोनों साथी एक-दूसरे के आत्मसम्मान और अधिकारों का सम्मान करते हैं, तो दांपत्य जीवन में सुख, शांति और समृद्धि का वास होता है।', `kids_text` = 'संतान सुख और पारिवारिक परवरिश के क्षेत्र में इनका तालमेल 6.8/10 है। मेष बच्चों में आत्मविश्वास, साहस और अनुशासन का संचार करते हैं, जबकि वृश्चिक उन्हें स्नेह, संस्कार और भावनात्मक सुरक्षा प्रदान करती हैं। माता-पिता के रूप में इनका संयुक्त दृष्टिकोण बच्चों के सर्वांगीण विकास के लिए अत्यंत लाभकारी सिद्ध होता है।', `finance_text` = 'आर्थिक प्रबंधन और धन संचय में दोनों का तालमेल 6.8/10 है। मेष नए अवसरों और प्रगतिशील योजनाओं में रुचि रखते हैं, जबकि वृश्चिक बचत, स्थिरता और भविष्य की सुरक्षा पर बल देती हैं। साझा बजट और पारदर्शी वित्तीय निर्णयों से दोनों अपने परिवार के लिए एक सुदृढ़ आर्थिक आधार तैयार करते हैं।' WHERE `id` = 32;
UPDATE `zodiac_compatibility` SET `slug` = 'aries-man-sagittarius-woman', `element_pair` = 'Fire + Fire', `meta_title` = 'Aries Man and Sagittarius Woman Compatibility: Love, Marriage & Trust (84%)', `meta_description` = 'Explore Aries man and Sagittarius woman compatibility (84%). Discover how Fire and Fire elements align in love, marriage, trust, emotional intimacy, and long-term harmony.', `verdict_summary` = 'A deeply vibrant and harmonious pairing uniting the Bold Trailblazer with the Free Philosopher. Governed by Mars and Jupiter, this Fire + Fire connection enjoys natural chemistry, high devotion, and strong long-term staying power.', `key_strength` = 'Their strongest resonance lies in Love (8.8/10). Here, shared passion, spontaneous adventure, boundless inspiration, and radiant enthusiasm. Under the combined guidance of Mars and Jupiter, they bring out each other''s finest qualities.', `key_challenge` = 'Their primary area of conscious work occurs in Dependability (7.0/10). Potential tension arises from ego clashes, competitive friction, and fiery impatience during disagreements. Channel competitive energy into common ambitions and take turns yielding ground during arguments.', `faq_json` = '[{"question": "Are an Aries man and a Sagittarius woman compatible in marriage?", "answer": "Yes, Aries man and Sagittarius woman hold a marriage compatibility score of 8.3/10. Their union succeeds when Aries''s unstoppable momentum complements Sagittarius''s infectious optimism, providing a stable balance of passion and loyalty."}, {"question": "How do Aries and Sagittarius build lasting trust?", "answer": "With a trust rating of 7.6/10, security is established through transparent dialogue and consistent actions. Channel competitive energy into common ambitions and take turns yielding ground during arguments."}, {"question": "What is the secret to resolving conflict between an Aries man and a Sagittarius woman?", "answer": "The key is navigating Fire and Fire temperaments. He should appreciate Sagittarius''s natural emotional rhythm, while she gives Aries the space and respect needed to speak openly without defensiveness."}]', `general_text` = 'The connection between an Aries man and a Sagittarius woman is a compelling blend of Fire and Fire forces. Representing the Bold Trailblazer with the Free Philosopher, their overall compatibility stands at 8.4/10 (84%). He enters the relationship with a passionate, direct, energetic, fiercely independent presence, while she contributes a optimistic, candid, adventurous, wisdom-seeking energy. When their cosmic currents align, their shared passion, spontaneous adventure, boundless inspiration, and radiant enthusiasm creates a vibrant environment where both partners feel recognized, celebrated, and inspired to grow.', `love_text` = 'In romance (8.8/10), this union is infused with genuine passion and romantic discovery. Ruled by Mars, Aries conveys affection through unstoppable momentum, while Sagittarius, influenced by Jupiter, expresses love through infectious optimism. Their romantic chemistry thrives when both partners honor each other''s pace, expressing tenderness through meaningful shared moments and unconditional devotion.', `friendship_text` = 'As companions (8.2/10), their rapport is built on mutual curiosity and shared activities. Whether engaging in energetic debates or embarking on weekend getaways, their connection benefits from shared passion, spontaneous adventure, boundless inspiration, and radiant enthusiasm. They uplift one another, offering a supportive sounding board where new plans and ideas are met with genuine encouragement.', `trust_text` = 'Trust and fidelity achieve a score of 7.6/10. Aries values transparency and authentic intention, whereas Sagittarius thrives when emotional reliability is proven day after day. To deepen their bond, they must keep commitments, address uncertainties before they fester, and create a safe emotional sanctuary free from judgment.', `dependability_text` = 'Dependability rates at 7.0/10 in this partnership. During unforeseen life hurdles, he steps up with courageous leadership, while she provides philosophical truth. By dividing responsibilities according to their natural talents, they establish a secure, well-coordinated team.', `longevity_text` = 'The long-term resilience of this couple is rated at 8.1/10. A sustainable bond relies on both individuals continually reinventing their shared goals as seasons change. By embracing personal growth and avoiding stagnation, this Fire + Fire relationship deepens into an enduring life companionship.', `marriage_text` = 'In matrimony (8.3/10), establishing domestic harmony and shared core values is the cornerstone of success. A Aries man and Sagittarius woman create a thriving home when household choices, family rituals, and conflict resolutions are handled equitably. Honoring their elemental differences ensures both partners feel equally cherished and empowered within the marriage.', `kids_text` = 'When raising children and cultivating family life (7.0/10), this couple balances warmth with constructive guidance. Aries inspires their children with confidence, curiosity, and vitality, while Sagittarius surrounds them with emotional security, practical ethics, and unconditional care. Together, they provide a well-rounded and nurturing upbringing.', `finance_text` = 'Financial cooperation reaches a rating of 7.0/10. Aries''s approach to resources balances ambition and opportunity, while Sagittarius emphasizes foresight, stability, and prudent management. By maintaining transparent budgets and agreeing on joint investment priorities, they construct a prosperous and stress-free economic future.' WHERE `id` = 33;
