conflict between a Capricorn man and a Gemini woman?", "answer": "The key is navigating Earth and Air temperaments. He should appreciate Gemini''s natural emotional rhythm, while she gives Capricorn the space and respect needed to speak openly without defensiveness."}]', `general_text` = 'The connection between a Capricorn man and a Gemini woman is a compelling blend of Earth and Air forces. Representing distinct cosmic energies, their overall compatibility stands at 7.1/10 (71%). He enters the relationship with a disciplined, ambitious, patient, profoundly reliable presence, while she contributes a witty, versatile, intellectually curious, adaptable energy. When their cosmic currents align, their Air formulates innovative visions while Earth constructs the tangible roadmap to materialize them creates a vibrant environment where both partners feel recognized, celebrated, and inspired to grow.', `love_text` = 'In romance (7.1/10), this union is infused with genuine passion and romantic discovery. Ruled by Saturn, Capricorn conveys affection through generational stability, while Gemini, influenced by Mercury, expresses love through sparkling communication. Their romantic chemistry thrives when both partners honor each other''s pace, expressing tenderness through meaningful shared moments and unconditional devotion.', `friendship_text` = 'As companions (6.6/10), their rapport is built on mutual curiosity and shared activities. Whether engaging in energetic debates or embarking on weekend getaways, their connection benefits from Air formulates innovative visions while Earth constructs the tangible roadmap to materialize them. They uplift one another, offering a supportive sounding board where new plans and ideas are met with genuine encouragement.', `trust_text` = 'Trust and fidelity achieve a score of 7.0/10. Capricorn values transparency and authentic intention, whereas Gemini thrives when emotional reliability is proven day after day. To deepen their bond, they must keep commitments, address uncertainties before they fester, and create a safe emotional sanctuary free from judgment.', `dependability_text` = 'Dependability rates at 7.3/10 in this partnership. During unforeseen life hurdles, he steps up with integrity, while she provides endless playfulness. By dividing responsibilities according to their natural talents, they establish a secure, well-coordinated team.', `longevity_text` = 'The long-term resilience of this couple is rated at 6.9/10. A sustainable bond relies on both individuals continually reinventing their shared goals as seasons change. By embracing personal growth and avoiding stagnation, this Earth + Air relationship deepens into an enduring life companionship.', `marriage_text` = 'In matrimony (7.0/10), establishing domestic harmony and shared core values is the cornerstone of success. A Capricorn man and Gemini woman create a thriving home when household choices, family rituals, and conflict resolutions are handled equitably. Honoring their elemental differences ensures both partners feel equally cherished and empowered within the marriage.', `kids_text` = 'When raising children and cultivating family life (6.8/10), this couple balances warmth with constructive guidance. Capricorn inspires their children with confidence, curiosity, and vitality, while Gemini surrounds them with emotional security, practical ethics, and unconditional care. Together, they provide a well-rounded and nurturing upbringing.', `finance_text` = 'Financial cooperation reaches a rating of 7.3/10. Capricorn''s approach to resources balances ambition and opportunity, while Gemini emphasizes foresight, stability, and prudent management. By maintaining transparent budgets and agreeing on joint investment priorities, they construct a prosperous and stress-free economic future.' WHERE `id` = 441;
